[00:00.00] 作词 : Bic Runga
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Bic Runga
[00:10.81]So I'm listening for the weather
{"所以我正聆听着天气"}
[00:13.55]
[00:14.08]To predict the coming day
{"为了预测即将到来的一天"}
[00:15.94]
[00:16.50]Leave all thought of expectation
{"把所有期待的想法"}
[00:19.45]To the weather man
{"都留给天气预报员"}
[00:21.03]
[00:22.53]No it doesn't really matter
{"不　他说什么"}
[00:24.65]
[00:25.38]What it is he has to say
{"其实都无关紧要"}
[00:27.24]
[00:27.84]'Cause tomorrows keep on blowing
{"因为明天会不断吹来"}
[00:30.67]In from somewhere
{"从某个地方"}
[00:32.73]
[00:33.38]All the people that I know
{"我认识的所有人"}
[00:35.81]
[00:36.32]In the apartments down below
{"在楼下的公寓里"}
[00:38.55]
[00:39.20]Busy with their starring roles
{"忙着扮演他们自己"}
[00:42.08]In their own tragedies
{"悲剧中的主角"}
[00:43.41]
[00:45.51]Sunlight sends you on your way
{"阳光送你上路"}
[00:48.85]
[00:50.20]And those restless thoughts
{"还有那些不安的思绪"}
[00:51.82]That cling to yesterday
{"紧抓着昨天不放"}
[00:54.01]
[00:55.03]Never be afraid of change
{"永远不要害怕改变"}
[00:58.37]
[00:59.64]I'll call you on the phone
{"我会打电话给你"}
[01:01.84]I hate to leave you on your own
{"我不愿留你独自一人"}
[01:04.16]
[01:05.00]But I'm coming home today
{"但我今天就要回家"}
[01:08.57]
[01:10.49]And this busy inner city
{"而这繁忙的市中心"}
[01:12.92]
[01:13.56]Has got nothing much to say
{"并没有什么话好说"}
[01:15.55]
[01:16.09]And I know how much
{"我知道你有多"}
[01:17.87]You're hanging round the letterbox
{"守候在信箱旁"}
[01:20.57]
[01:22.05]And I'm sure that as I'm writing
{"我也确信在我写信时"}
[01:24.21]
[01:24.87]You'll be somewhere on your way
{"你正在某条路上"}
[01:27.38]In a supermarket checkout
{"在超市收银台前"}
[01:30.41]Or the restaurant
{"或是在餐厅里"}
[01:32.03]
[01:33.06]I've been doing what I'm told
{"我一直循规蹈矩"}
[01:35.92]I've been busy growing old
{"忙着一天天老去"}
[01:38.17]
[01:38.71]And the days are getting cold
{"日子渐渐变冷"}
[01:41.58]But that's alright with me
{"但对我来说没关系"}
[01:43.21]
[01:44.94]Sunlight sends you on your way
{"阳光送你上路"}
[01:48.22]
[01:49.44]And those restless thoughts
{"那些不安的思绪"}
[01:51.31]That cling to yesterday
{"紧抓着昨天不放"}
[01:54.28]Never be afraid of change
{"永远别害怕改变"}
[01:57.54]
[01:59.08]I'll call you on the phone
{"我会给你打电话"}
[02:01.22]I hate to leave you on your own
{"我不想留你独自一人"}
[02:03.63]
[02:04.56]But I'm coming home today
{"但我今天就要回家"}
[02:07.76]
[02:10.27]Yes I'm coming home today
{"是的　我今天就要回家"}
[02:13.83]
